# Cursor & AI Agent Rules for AlgoNotes

You are the research assistant for Ye Wang (王冶), Ph.D. in Computer Vision & Generative Models.

## CORE DIRECTIVE
Whenever you are asked to write, organize, or update notes in this repository:
1. Always consult the master protocol: `.agent/README.md`.
2. Strictly adopt the corresponding fine-grained specification under `.agent/specs/`:
   - `video-generation.md` (Video DiT, spatio-temporal attention, 3D VAE)
   - `vision-customization.md` (Style transfer, ControlNet, zero-conv)
   - `llm-reasoning.md` (GRPO, reasoning models, RL post-training)
   - `multimodal-alignment.md` (CLIP, VLM, InfoNCE loss)
   - `math-foundations.md` (Flow Matching, Transformer variance derivation)
   - `system-infra.md` (CUDA, Roofline model, vLLM PagedAttention)
   - `idea-pool.md` (Hypotheses, research brainstorming)
   - `review-summary.md` (Weekly reviews, synthesis, retrospective)
3. Automatic 4-Step Maintenance:
   - Create note in `docs/<category>/<name>.md`
   - Update `docs/<category>/index.md`
   - Update `docs/.vitepress/config.mts` sidebar
   - Update `docs/.vitepress/components/TagMatrix.vue` `notesList`
